        <mxCell id="Wur4yQl7wxwldy29yAvg-88" value="These three comprise your &lt;em&gt;chemical core&lt;/em&gt; — conversion of H₂ + N₂ → NH₃ → HNO₃ → NH₄NO₃.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;All other processes depend on this train." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="Wur4yQl7wxwldy29yAvg-105">
